  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantAccountingPoliciesForPreparationOfConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;（連結財務諸表作成のための基本となる重要な事項）&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;１．連結の範囲に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:9pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:162pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
